      "en": "• In addition to transforming into Phoenix mode by recombining, the characteristic Siguru Seal and F Funnel can be attached and detached!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• その他、ライフル武器やビームサーベルなど豊富な武装も再現！劇中の様々なポージングを自在に再現できる！",
      "en": "• In addition, various weapons such as rifle weapons and beam sabers are also reproduced! You can freely reproduce various poses in the play!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 初回限定版のみアニメ告知パッケージ仕様となっている！",
      "en": "• Only the first limited edition comes with an anime announcement package!"
